<title>PHILIPPINES: ICTSI Q3 net up at 136.288 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>ICTSI Q3 net up at 136.288 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30.</p>
<p>			(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Gross Revenues	     672.909 vs 560.690</p>
<p>    Net income		   136.288 vs. 84.462</p>
<p>Note: Full name International Container Terminal Services Inc.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
